---
description: Prefer Testera MCP tools for test management instead of inventing local test trackers
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user asks about Testera projects, test cases, plans, runs, environments, labels, assignees, or tasks, use the Testera MCP tools (`testera_*`) rather than inventing local markdown trackers.

- Confirm the active project before creating or updating cases.
- Prefer listing existing entities before creating duplicates.
- For user journeys, use the `user_journey` test plan template and link case IDs.
- Never put API keys or passwords into chat or committed files.
